  "painter": "mix",
  "note": "Matte black that swallows light, faint violet star-dust on the shaft, a violet black-hole swirl on the forearm, a black snakeskin grip split by glowing violet cracks, and a black hole ringed in violet light on the sleeve. The swirl turns (Moving).",
  "ai": {
    "forearm": {
      "refs": [
        "forearm",
        "closeup"
      ],
      "prompt": "The forearm is deep matte black (#050508) like outer space, with a glowing violet black-hole swirl as its centrepiece: a spiral vortex of bright violet and lavender light (#5B1FA8, #B98AF0) winding into a perfectly black round centre, placed on the middle row about 60 percent of the way from left to right, about 300 pixels across. Around it, thin wispy violet nebula streaks spiral outward and fade into the black, with a few tiny white star specks. The two thin strips at the far left are the joint collar: paint them plain flat silver grey (#9A9EA6)."
    },
    "butt": {
      "refs": [
        "wrap",
        "sleeve",
        "closeup"
      ],
      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): flat glowing violet (#B98AF0). The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): black snakeskin leather made of small rounded black scales (#050508 to #15121C), with a few thin jagged glowing violet cracks (#B98AF0) running through it diagonally. The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): deep black space with a black hole in the middle row: a perfectly black round disc about 150 pixels across ringed by a thin glowing violet accretion ring (#B98AF0 fading to #5B1FA8) with faint violet swirls around it and tiny star specks. The very thin strip at the far right: plain black."
    }
  },
